Wire Yan Long admin section to dedicated DB tables

- API: split into /api/admin/yanlong/reservations and /api/admin/yanlong/inquiries
  each targeting its own table (yanlong_reservations / yanlong_contact_submissions)
- Reservations page: displays typed columns (date, time, guests, service,
  occasion, seating_preference, special_requests)
- Inquiries page: adds inquiry_type filter (general/event/wedding/reservation)
- Removed obsolete shared-table migration + scripts
- All DB changes applied via Supabase MCP (yanlong_admin_fields,
  yanlong_reservations_status_values, yanlong_grant_anon_insert)
